## Frontend conventions (discovered)

### Routing (`frontend/src/App.tsx`)

- `BrowserRouter` in `main.tsx`; `ConfigProvider` + `AuthProvider` wrap all routes.
- **Private app** routes use `<Private>` → `RequireAuth` + `AppShell`: `/app`, `/app/fields`, `/app/fields/new`, `/app/fields/:id`, `/app/fields/:id/edit`, `/app/analyses`, `/app/analyses/:id`, `/app/account`.
- **Public** marketing/info: `/`, `/welcome`, auth (`/login`, `/register`, `/demo`), and `Shell`-wrapped `/nasa`, `/methodology`, `/retro`, `/about`, `/quick`.
- Field workspace URL: `/app/fields/:id` with optional query `?tab=<id>`. `FieldWorkspaceKeyed` remounts workspace when `id` changes (`key={id}`).

### Adding a field workspace tab (`FieldWorkspace.tsx`)

1. Add id to const `TABS` (union type derives from it).
2. Add Lucide icon to `ICONS` record.
3. Import workspace component; add `case` in `panel()` switch.
4. Add labels under `tabs.<id>` in `ru.json`, `kk.json`, `en.json` (same keys).
5. Tabs lazy-mount: `visited` Set keeps panels mounted after first open; inactive panels use `hidden={k !== tab}` and `role="tabpanel"`.

### API client (`frontend/src/api/client.ts`)

- All JSON: `fetch('/api' + path, { credentials: 'same-origin' })` with `Content-Type: application/json` and `X-Requested-With: agro`.
- Errors throw `ApiError(status, detail)`; use `errorText(e, t)` from `lib/async.ts` (maps `errors.*` i18n keys, 404, 503, network).
- Field endpoints: `api.field`, `api.fieldOverview`, `api.fieldMonitoring(fieldId, start?, end?)`, `api.fieldRisk`, etc.
- Background jobs: `api.job(id)` → `Job` with `status: running | done | failed`.
- Downloads use blob + `Content-Disposition` filename.

### Async state and job polling (`lib/async.ts`, `Monitoring.tsx`)

- `useAsync(fn, deps)` → `{ data, error, loading, reload, setData }`; stale responses ignored via sequence ref.
- **Monitoring pattern** (`useJobsPolling`): response may include `jobs[]` with `status === "pending"` and nested `job.id`. Poll `api.job` every 4s; if any job is no longer `running`, call `reload()`. Show `Notice` with `monitoring.pending` while pending.
- **Wizard** uses similar polling on compare/analyze job lists.
- Tab bodies: early return `ErrorBox` + `onRetry={reload}` on error; `Loading` until `data`; then render.

### Charts and provenance

- Wrap every chart in `ChartFrame`: `title`, optional `legend` (color swatches — solid, dashed, or band), `caption` (often starts with `KindBadge` + source title + period text), `table` with `columns` / `rows`, recharts inside `children`.
- Shared chart styling: import `AXIS`, `GRID`, `C`, `TooltipBox` from `ChartFrame.tsx`. `C` = precip/normal/dry/ndvi/band/warm/cool/moisture hex colors.
- Multi-series / rotation charts: `seriesColor(i)` and `SERIES` from `lib/colors.ts`; heat ramps: `RAMPS.ndvi`, `RAMPS.soil_moisture`, `RAMPS.precip`.
- Page-level source table: `SectionTitle` + `SourceList` with `sources: SourceMeta[]` and optional `periods` map by source id. `SourceList` maps source id → kind via `KIND` (power→reanalysis, modis/smap/gpm→observation, soilgrids→model).
- Unverified model params: `StatusBadge` (`components/common/StatusBadge.tsx`) — `verified` → `badge-green`, `assumption` → `badge-amber` + `app.needs_check` / `app.needs_check_title`.
- Data kind chips: `KindBadge` in `ui.tsx` (`badge-blue` observation, `badge-amber` model/simulation/assumption, etc.). Risk levels: `LevelBadge` → `badge-red` | `badge-amber` | `badge-green` | `badge-neutral`.

### Translations (`i18n.ts`, `locales/*.json`, `lib/i18n-text.ts`)

- i18next + `react-i18next`; resources loaded from `ru`, `kk`, `en` JSON; default/fallback `ru`; lang in `localStorage` key `agro.lang`.
- UI strings: nested JSON keys, `useTranslation()` → `t('section.key', { placeholders })`. Keep keys identical across all three locale files.
- API multilingual fields (`I18nText`): `tx(text, lang)` — prefers current lang, falls back to `ru`.
- `Lang` type and user profile lang align with `i18n.language`.

### Layout / Tailwind design tokens (`index.css`, `tailwind.config.js`)

- Surfaces: `bg-surface`, text `text-ink` / `text-ink-2` / `text-ink-muted` / `text-ink-subtle`, borders `border-line` / `border-line-strong`.
- Cards: `card` (padded) or `panel` + `panel-head` + `panel-body` (charts, tables, forms).
- Buttons: `btn-primary` (field green), `btn-secondary`, `btn-ghost`, `btn-danger`; compact `h-8` / `h-9` variants common.
- Badges: `badge-green` | `badge-amber` | `badge-red` | `badge-blue` | `badge-neutral`.
- Accent palette: `field-*` (primary brand green, e.g. active tab `border-field-700 text-field-800`), `status-good` | `status-warn` | `status-bad`.
- Tables: `table` class; numeric cells `num` (right-aligned tabular). Wide tables: `panel overflow-x-auto` + `min-w-[…]` on table — not page-level horizontal scroll.
- Typography utilities: `h1`, `h2`, `h3`, `eyebrow`, `label`, `input`.
- Spacing rhythm: workspace tabs often `space-y-6`; responsive grids `sm:grid-cols-2`, `xl:grid-cols-2` etc.; `.grid > * { min-width: 0 }` for shrink.

### Naming and imports

- One tab ≈ one file in `components/workspace/` (PascalCase default export).
- Icons: `lucide-react`. Numbers: `fmtNum` from `lib/format`; dates: `fmtDate` from `lib/async.ts`.
- Types for API shapes live in `api/types.ts`; extend client in `api/client.ts` only when backend exposes new routes (document backend needs in `docs/contracts/REQUESTS.md`).